  "writeGita": {
    "heading": {
      "id": "app.container.writeGita.heading",
      "defaultMessage": "Write Gita"
    },
    "description": {
      "id": "app.container.writeGita.description",
      "defaultMessage": "Write Gita is a campaign where you can prepare a handwritten scripture with your own hands. There are multiple book options to choose from: Ramcharitmanas, Gita Ji, Bhagavat, Bhakt Charitra, and others. You can select the scripture you wish to write. After your selection, we will send the original book, a register to write in, along with black and red pens to your home. It's essentially writing by copying, looking at the original text and writing it in the register. You have to write the shlokas with the red pen and the meaning in Hindi or your own regional language. You will also need to report your progress every 15 days. Upon completion of the entire scripture, we will honor you with a pictorial certificate. Moreover, whenever an exhibition is held, your handwritten scripture will be displayed in the handwritten scripture exhibition, and your name will be inscribed on the scripture."
    },
